{
  "$comment": [
    "Where every downloaded component comes from, and what it must hash to.",
    "",
    "This is data rather than Rust for one reason: scripts/update-components.mjs",
    "rewrites it every week and opens a pull request. A script editing Rust source",
    "with a regular expression is the shape that has already silently replaced the",
    "wrong thing in this repository once.",
    "",
    "url     the exact artefact. Never 'latest', never a branch - see the tests in",
    "        download.rs, which refuse both.",
    "sha256  read from the publisher, never computed from a downloaded file. A",
    "        digest computed here would attest that a file matches itself.",
    "        Absent means the publisher offers none; the component then installs",
    "        and records itself origin unverified.",
    "track   how the robot finds a newer version. null means it leaves this entry",
    "        alone. The pattern lives here, on the update side, and never in the",
    "        application: Volocal downloads a fixed address, and choosing a new one",
    "        is a pull request somebody reads."
  ],

